-- AkaAka consolidated schema baseline
-- Generated by concatenating historical migrations in timestamp order.
-- This file preserves the complete current schema for fresh environments and db reset.
-- Hosted Supabase projects retain their existing migration history; do not push this baseline
-- against a project whose migration history has been reset.
